    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rovee's Adventure Awaits You!</h2>Get ready to explore an uncharted planet and find minerals to complete Rovee's mission! Enter commands using the keyboard to command her toward success. But be careful, because Rovee's battery doesn't last very long. Once her battery dies, Rovee's mission comes to an end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838040/extras/66fa878b9d40a35835085484ff32534b.avif?t=1714396008\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Minerals!</h2>Intel reports that there are golden-like minerals located on the planet, and Rovee is here to collect them for analysis. Use the commands to your advantage so that she can collect the minerals and head back home safely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838040/extras/390391e501a8341d4eb9481a96d98707.avif?t=1714396008\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charge Up!</h2>A charger was left for you to use so that Rovee can charge her battery. Use it as much as you can, because that battery won't last forever! Make sure you keep an eye on her battery at all times!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838040/extras/c74d7e1b812b47799765a1ff069c088c.avif?t=1714396008\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><br>Please, take very good care of Rovee!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838040/extras/1866dde09eb705329be6cb68a8a07a80.avif?t=1714396008\" width=600 height=338 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rovee's Adventure Awaits You!</h2>Get ready to explore an uncharted planet and find minerals to complete Rovee's mission! Enter commands using the keyboard to command her toward success. But be careful, because Rovee's battery doesn't last very long. Once her battery dies, Rovee's mission comes to an end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838040/extras/66fa878b9d40a35835085484ff32534b.avif?t=1714396008\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Minerals!</h2>Intel reports that there are golden-like minerals located on the planet, and Rovee is here to collect them for analysis. Use the commands to your advantage so that she can collect the minerals and head back home safely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838040/extras/390391e501a8341d4eb9481a96d98707.avif?t=1714396008\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charge Up!</h2>A charger was left for you to use so that Rovee can charge her battery. Use it as much as you can, because that battery won't last forever! Make sure you keep an eye on her battery at all times!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838040/extras/c74d7e1b812b47799765a1ff069c088c.avif?t=1714396008\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><br>Please, take very good care of Rovee!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838040/extras/1866dde09eb705329be6cb68a8a07a80.avif?t=1714396008\" width=600 height=338 /></span>",
